	(text "LM3940: Cin >= 0.47uF (C30). Cout C23 = 33uF\nwith ESR in the datasheet band. Prefer tantalum.\nA lone 0805 ceramic 33uF can be too-low ESR;\nadd ~0.5 ohm series if C23 is ceramic."
